    hydro_min_flow_floor: { cell: "K", ev: "O -> K 2026-09-23 (hydro-5): PROMOTED on the owner ruling; keeper 2026-09-22-hydro-5-spp-floor. U -> O 2026-09-22 (hydro-5): TESTED BY SOLVE ON ALL SEVEN REGISTERED YEARS 2019-2025, one shard per year (rule 36), against keeper spp-71 (form 4, G-DRIFT all INERT). RECOMMENDED FOR PROMOTION, owner ruling OPEN (rule 31). Admissibility measured, not assumed: SWPP files no NG:PS but NG:WAT shows 0 hours above the 3,103.5 MW conventional nameplate and 0 negative hours in 2019-2025, and a fold of Salina (259 MW) cannot reach the Q95 level the floor reads. MEASURED arm vs keeper: hours at 0 MW 1,191-3,209 -> 0 in every year; p05 0 -> 169-406 MW (measured 281-681); top-decile water share 0.149-0.212 -> 0.133-0.191 (measured 0.112-0.132); within-month daily CV 0.457-0.718 -> 0.283-0.571 (measured 0.071-0.160); annual hydro -0.004..+0.031 %. G4: 0 PASS->FAIL flips in 7 years. Two gate misses, explained: G1 2019 fleet 9.3 MW under the floor in 85 July hours (Pensacola's share exceeds its nameplate, clipped by min_gen <= pmax); G2 monthly 2025 May +0.276 % (upward, the keeper's own economic spill). LIMIT: banking still 2-5x measured and p95 at nameplate 2019-21 — the Missouri-mainstem daily-release schedule is unrepresented (named successor). Chosen over hydro_ror_split on coverage, pre-registered. Record: docs/RESULT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md; PRECOMMIT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md" },
    hydro_ror_split: { cell: "O", ev: "U -> O 2026-09-22 (hydro-5): TESTED BY SOLVE ON ALL SEVEN YEARS 2019-2025, classifier reviewed on SWPP's own labelled subset (12/16 plants, 92.3 % of labelled MW; SPP added to curate_hydro_plant_modes.DEFAULT_ISOS). RoR class is only 8 plants / 320 MW / 9-14 % of energy. MEASURED: hours at 0 MW 1,191-3,209 -> 0; p05 0 -> 73-113 MW; top-dec 0.149-0.212 -> 0.144-0.201; daily CV 0.457-0.718 -> 0.410-0.647; annual hydro -0.001..+0.011 %; G4 0 flips. Correct but weaker than hydro_min_flow_floor on every statistic in every year — it cannot reach the mainstem banking. NOT recommended for SPP (the floor is, pre-registered); never stacked with it (rule 19). Record: docs/RESULT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md; PRECOMMIT-hydro-5-2026-09-22.md" },
